<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Quantity> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/dbpediaMatch> "http://dbpedia.org/resource/Quantity"^^xsd:anyURI .


###  http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Verifiable
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Verifiable> rdf:type <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/AspectClass> .


